    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "PAA\nConquest\nof the Pacific\nAPRIL 1935\nPAN AMERICAN SURVEY FLIGHT - HONOLÜLU TO SAN FRANCISCO\nAAMC \"4-D 1230a\nAFTER A FIVE-DAY LAYOVER IN HAWAN, MUS/CK\nAND HIS CREW RETURNED TO SAN FRANCISCO ON APRIL ZZ\nON AN UNGUENTRUL FLIGHT\n....\na. Sikorsky S-42. + P-W Hornet engines, 40,000 Ib. a.u.w., 32 passengers, 160 m.p.h.,\n11S' span, 68' long.",
